>: Parameter \"confined_surface\" is null\"\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96d5d9d0-1e40-4102-85be-c63d7a082766\n\nI don't really know how to code c++ to fix this, and this is also my first pull request so i'm hoping someone in the comunity can help me. Feel free to ask for more details about my system. Also idk how to add labels to this i hope someone can do that for me because i have no idea how.\n\n\n### System information\n\nLinux, idk how to fill this correctly, check the former field. \n\n### Issue description\n\ncheck the first field\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nehh check the former field .-.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\ni wrote a short guide in the first field","closed_by":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116232/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116232/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comm